### Pruebas manuales (extension "REST Client" de VS Code, o Rider/Visual Studio).
### Levantar la API:  ASPNETCORE_ENVIRONMENT=Development dotnet run --urls http://localhost:5180
@host = http://localhost:5180
@origin = http://localhost:3000

### Salud
GET {{host}}/health

### Reglas comerciales y metodos de envio/pago
GET {{host}}/api/config

### Catalogo
GET {{host}}/api/products?category=buzos&sort=precio-asc

###
GET {{host}}/api/products/hoodie-flight-arena

###
GET {{host}}/api/products/search?q=campera&limit=6

###
GET {{host}}/api/categories

### Registro (devuelve la cookie de sesion y el cupon de bienvenida)
# @name register
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{origin}}

{
  "firstName": "Ana",
  "lastName": "Pérez",
  "email": "ana@example.com",
  "password": "clave12345",
  "newsletter": true,
  "acceptTerms": true
}

### Login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{origin}}

{ "email": "ana@example.com", "password": "clave12345", "remember": true }

### Mi usuario (usa la cookie)
GET {{host}}/api/auth/me

### Validar un cupon
POST {{host}}/api/coupons/validate
Content-Type: application/json

{ "code": "STREET10", "subtotal": 100000 }

### Presupuesto: totales calculados por el servidor
POST {{host}}/api/checkout/quote
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [{ "productId": "p-001", "colorId": "negro", "size": "M", "quantity": 2 }],
  "couponCode": "STREET10",
  "shippingMethod": "estandar",
  "paymentMethod": "transferencia"
}

### Checkout (invitado o con sesion). Con Mercado Pago devuelve payment.redirectUrl
# @name checkout
POST {{host}}/api/checkout
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{origin}}

{
  "clientOrderId": "ord_demo_001",
  "email": "ana@example.com",
  "firstName": "Ana",
  "lastName": "Pérez",
  "phone": "11 5555-1234",
  "street": "Honduras",
  "number": "5000",
  "apartment": "3B",
  "city": "CABA",
  "province": "CABA",
  "zip": "C1414",
  "notes": "",
  "shippingMethod": "estandar",
  "paymentMethod": "mercadopago",
  "acceptTerms": true,
  "items": [{ "productId": "p-001", "colorId": "arena", "size": "M", "quantity": 1 }]
}

### Pedido por id publico (el de /checkout/exito?orden=...)
@orderId = {{checkout.response.body.$.order.id}}
GET {{host}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}

### Confirmar contra Mercado Pago al volver del checkout (payment_id viene en la URL de retorno)
POST {{host}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}/reconcile
Content-Type: application/json

{ "paymentId": "1234567890" }

### Mis pedidos
GET {{host}}/api/orders

### Simular un estado de pago (solo Payments:Provider=Mock con Payments:AllowSimulation=true)
POST {{host}}/api/dev/payments/simulate
Content-Type: application/json

{ "orderId": "{{orderId}}", "status": "approved" }

### Contacto
POST {{host}}/api/contact
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Ana", "email": "ana@example.com", "topic": "pedido", "orderNumber": "BRV-ABC234", "message": "Hola, quiero saber donde esta mi pedido." }

### Newsletter
POST {{host}}/api/newsletter
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "ana@example.com" }

### ------------------ Admin (iniciar sesion con el usuario Admin) ------------------

### Login admin (en Development: admin@birvenn.local / DevAdmin123)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{origin}}

{ "email": "admin@birvenn.local", "password": "DevAdmin123" }

### Pedidos pendientes
GET {{host}}/api/admin/orders?status=pendiente&page=1&pageSize=20

### Confirmar una transferencia recibida
POST {{host}}/api/admin/orders/{{orderId}}/confirm-payment
Origin: {{origin}}

### Avanzar un pedido (preparando, enviado, entregado, cancelado)
PATCH {{host}}/api/admin/orders/{{orderId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{origin}}

{ "status": "enviado", "trackingCode": "OCA123456" }

### Fijar stock de un talle
PUT {{host}}/api/admin/products/p-001/stock
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{origin}}

{ "size": "M", "quantity": 20 }
